# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data: far too large for git (several GB of GeoTIFFs). Only the documentation
# and the scene catalogue are tracked; everything else is rebuilt locally with
# the data pipeline (see Datasets/README.md).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets/*
!Datasets/README.md
!Datasets/scene_catalogue.csv

# Any stray geospatial data elsewhere in the repo
*.tif
*.tiff
*.TIF
*.gpkg
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.nc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model outputs: weights and evaluation plots are regenerated by train.py and
# evaluate.py. Share trained weights through GitHub Releases, not commits.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.onnx
Scripts/training/checkpoints/
Scripts/training/analysis/
runs/
outputs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
